{
  "airport_id": "HYD",
  "airport_name": "Rajiv Gandhi International Airport, Hyderabad",
  "scope": "Passenger processing and assistance touchpoints: departures, arrivals, transfers and general aviation; excludes retail, dining and landside transport.",
  "limitations": [
    "Public-source starter inventory, not an exhaustive verified register of every counter, gate or lane. Request the airport operational asset inventory for complete physical coverage.",
    "All SYN IDs, zone identifiers, domestic/international group splits, arrival rates, channel counts and service durations are POC assumptions.",
    "Published pages can change and contain inconsistent details; no physical counter totals or gate numbering ranges have been inferred.",
    "Service channels in the simulator are parallel service slots, not asserted counts of airport counters; baggage reclaim uses an approximate service-delay model.",
    "Queue groups are independent and do not conserve passengers across the airport journey. Summing group arrivals is not airport throughput.",
    "Disabled candidate entries require confirmation before use. Other optional commercial amenities are outside passenger-processing scope."
  ],
